      "payload": "{\"op\":\"create_thought\",\"thought\":{\"type\":\"claim\",\"status\":\"tentative\",\"title\":\"Alignment requires generalization beyond training\",\"statement\":\"Aligned behavior during training does not establish that an AI will preserve human values in unfamiliar situations. Alignment must persist even when the system believes human supervision is absent.\"}}",
